      {
        "subject": "The Sunday Otter — Issue #112: Rivers, rafts, and remote work",
        "labels": ["INBOX", "CATEGORY_UPDATES"],
        "messages": [
          {
            "from": {
              "name": "The Sunday Otter",
              "email": "hello@sundayotter.example"
            },
            "hoursAgo": 30,
            "unread": true,
            "headers": {
              "List-Unsubscribe": "<mailto:unsubscribe@sundayotter.example?subject=unsubscribe>, <https://sundayotter.example/unsubscribe/demo>",
              "List-Unsubscribe-Post": "List-Unsubscribe=One-Click"
            },
            "text": "The Sunday Otter, issue #112.\n\nRivers are back: after three dry summers, the valley's rivers ran full this week.\n\nRafts, reconsidered: why a plank of wood is the best office chair.\n\nRemote work from the riverbank: five readers on their setups.",
            "html": "<!doctype html><html><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f4f1ea\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ea\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <tr><td style=\"background:#0f766e;padding:28px 32px;color:#fff;font:700 26px/1.2 Georgia,serif\">The Sunday Otter</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><img src=\"cid:hero-river\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"></td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 32px;font:16px/1.6 Georgia,serif;color:#333\">Good morning! This week: rivers running full again, a surprising defence of rafts, and five readers who work from the riverbank.</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #eee\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font:600 18px/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:#111\">Rivers are back</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font:15px/1.6 Georgia,serif;color:#333\">After three dry summers, the valley's rivers ran full this week. We walked the old towpath from the mill to the weir and counted eleven herons.</p>\n        <a href=\"https://example.com/read\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;background:#0f766e;color:#fff;font:600 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none\">Read the story</a>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #eee\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font:600 18px/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:#111\">Rafts, reconsidered</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font:15px/1.6 Georgia,serif;color:#333\">A plank of wood, lashed to three more planks, might be the best office chair ever made. Our columnist spent a week finding out.</p>\n        <a href=\"https://example.com/read\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;background:#0f766e;color:#fff;font:600 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none\">Continue reading</a>\n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #eee\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font:600 18px/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:#111\">Remote work from the riverbank</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font:15px/1.6 Georgia,serif;color:#333\">Five readers share their setups: solar panels, dry bags, and one very patient dog.</p>\n        \n      </td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px;background:#fafafa;color:#888;font:12px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif\">You're receiving this because you subscribed at sundayotter.example. The Sunday Otter, 1 Weir Lane, Rivertown.<br><a href=\"https://example.com/unsubscribe\" style=\"color:#888\">Unsubscribe</a> · <a href=\"https://example.com/preferences\" style=\"color:#888\">Email preferences</a></td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr></table>\n</body></html>",
            "attachments": []
          }
        ]
      },
